Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-8dlxdK48' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-11-20 23:08:08.652 xcodebuild[34277:66551629]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-11-20 23:08:08.759 xcodebuild[34277:66551628] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\n/Users/lchingen/hivemind\nsrc/hivemind/views/judging.py:81:    last = store.current_state(conn, view_id)\nsrc/hivemind/views/judging.py:85:        state = store.current_state(conn, theme_id)\nsrc/hivemind/views/judging.py:145:            state = store.current_state(conn, target)\nsrc/hivemind/views/judging.py:172:    last = store.current_state(conn, view_id)\nsrc/hivemind/views/judging.py:226:    last = store.current_state(conn, view_id)\nsrc/hivemind/views/store.py:230:def current_state(conn, view_id):\nscripts/show_views.py:31:        state = store.current_state(conn, v['view_id'])\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
